  "title-00": "Special Rugby World Cup 2023 guide",
  "subtitle-hero-ebook-inner": "Discover our tips for making the most of the Rugby World Cup 2023: increase your attendance, your average ticket and your sales with our guide.",
  "name-value": "Guide spécial Coupe du Monde de Rugby 2023",
  "image-form-ebook-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/647cee60a16d98407c906527_3%20couvertures%20magazine%20supperpos%C3%A9s%201.avif",
