  "rt-thank-you-html": "\n                    <h2>Your white paper is available 👇</h2>\n                    <h2>Boost your restaurant for the Rugby World Cup!</h2>\n                    <p><strong>Thank you!</strong></p>\n                    <p><a href=\"https://5696087.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5696087/Livres%20blancs/Coupe%20du%20Monde%20de%20Rugby%202023.pdf\">Download</a></p>\n                    <p>Thank you <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/en\">Innovorder</a> team</p>\n                  ",
  "rt-ebook-html": "\n              <p>Did you know that 7 out of 10 people plan to watch matches at home? Download this guide to adapt to this new trend!</p>\n            ",
  "temoignage-img-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/647cee75c08c36dc4f8ccc53_illu%20ballon%20rugby%201.avif",
  "temoignage-img-class": "temoignage-img",
  "icon-ebook-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6496c09ebbeb019764e0a0ce_Picto%20euro.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html": "\n            <p><strong>How do you organize this unforgettable event? </strong>Our best advice: equipment, decoration, communication, atmosphere, menus, entertainment, etc.</p>\n          ",
  "icon-ebook-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6496c0cad63c5d39f97ed12c_Picto%20horloge.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes-2": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset-2": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-2": "\n            <p><strong>How do you manage traffic?</strong> To serve a maximum number of customers on the street, in your establishment and at home.</p>\n          ",
  "icon-ebook-src-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6496c0d394873c8b56360c17_Picto%20fus%C3%A9e%201.avif",
  "icon-ebook-sizes-3": null,
  "icon-ebook-srcset-3": null,
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-3": "\n            <p><strong>How can you be more productive?</strong> Whether in the kitchen or the dining room, discover our tips for becoming an expert.</p>\n          ",
  "rt-decouvrirez-block-html-4": "\n          <p>For restaurateurs, the <strong>Rugby World Cup</strong> represents an exceptional opportunity to boost your business and enhance your reputation. </p>\n          <p>Don't wait any longer - follow our advice!</p>\n        "
 }
